<<Reset>>
<<Scene #000000 0.985>>

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: ZORAN! I'm at your gates! Come out and face me like a MAN!

<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: [smoothWave]Oh, Brigada...[/smoothWave]
Zoran: You still don't see it, do you?

<<Act Brigada brigadaChill 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: See WHAT? That you're a coward hiding behind a child queen? <br>Like...
Beigada: Like some half baked regent!!

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Actually... <br>I've been meaning to have this conversation. Both of you. Together.
Zoran: This "child queen" was merely a means to an end.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: You think I came here to ADVISE her?

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: Then what ARE you doing here?!

<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I've been BUSY, honey.

<<Scene #000000 0.585>>
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: While you were busy counting rats and raising a child that isn't mine, I've been making friends.

<<Act Jamal jamalChill 0.8 0.1 #505050>>
Jamal: Yo, hold up. I ain't yours?

<<Act Zoran zoranAngry 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I was pomising titles to mayors, tax relief to vassals...
Zoran: Simple men like them are so easy to bribe.
Zoran: and now...
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: They all answer to me.

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: What... what are you saying?

<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I'm saying, my dear wife, that the old king is dead.
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The princess is... inexperienced... to put it lightly.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: And someone witha an iron fist NEEDS to take the reigns of this sorry kingdom.

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: YOU?! A pig trader on the THRONE?!

<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I was going to take this kingdom QUIETLY. Methodically. Without a drop of blood.

<<Act Zoran zoranAngry 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: But then YOU showed up with your RAVENS and your DECREES and your NIGHT CHILD!

<<Act Brigada brigadaTalk 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: I was FIGHTING for our MARRIAGE!

<<Act Zoran zoranAngry 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: THERE IS NO MARRIAGE! It was a TRANSACTION!
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: But now? Now I don't need to hide anymore.
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: I'll take this kingdom... 
Zoran: And now i realize something...
Zoran: Why settle for just one crown, when you brought yours to take on a silver platter as well!

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngryRat 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: OVER MY DEAD BODY !
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: That's rather the idea, yes.

<<Act Wizard wizardChill 0.75 0.2 #61eb45>>
Wizard: Saar, the troops are moving into position as you requested.
Wizard: Also, most of the vassals have sent word. They are ready to swear fealty to you.

<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Excellent. Tell them the princesses send their regards.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: From her GRAVE!

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: I'LL KILL YOU!
Brigada: JAMAL! GET MAMA'S MACE!

<<Act Jamal jamalChill 0.8 0.1 #505050>>
Jamal: Nah, ma. I'm good.
<<Act Brigada brigadaSurprise 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: WHAT?!

<<Act Jamal jamalChains1 0.8 0.2 #505050>>
Jamal: You crampin' my style, cuh. Always tellin' me what to do.
<<Act Jamal jamalTalk 0.8 0.2 #505050>>
Jamal: I got my own crew now. We got that tower on the hill.
<<Act Jamal jamalChains2 0.8 0.2 #505050>>
Jamal: Anyone steps to us? They get the works.

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngryRat 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: JAMAL! You listen to your mother RIGHT NOW!

<<Act Jamal jamalChill 0.8 0.1 #505050>>
Jamal: Love you ma, but I'm my own man now.
Jamal: The HUSTLE calls. Ye ye.
<<Hide Jamal>>

<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: ...He gets that from your side.

<<Act Brigada brigadaAngry 1.0 0.2 #7E00FF>>
Brigada: I'll deal with YOU first, Zoran! Then I'll bring my son home!

<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: You can try, darling.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: But you're not fighting a rat trader anymore.
Zoran: You're fighting the future ruler of <color=orange>Tamnica Tsardom</color>.

<<Scene #000000 0.585>>
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Good luck... Your Majesty.

<<StopAudioAll>>
